{"seq":12,"slug":"baidu-ai","title":"百度AI 企业文化与管理","stage":"DONE","category":"corporate-management","chapterCount":7,"docCount":28,"url":"/h/corporate-management/baidu-ai","rating":{"composite":3.72,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.2,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":4}},"introMarkdown":"# 百度AI 企业文化与管理 简介\n\n百度是中国最早将人工智能确立为核心战略的科技公司之一。自创立搜索引擎起家，百度在过去十余年间经历了从互联网公司到AI公司的深刻蜕变。创始人李彦宏以技术出身的背景，将\"技术改变世界\"的信仰融入企业基因，推动百度在深度学习、自然语言处理、自动驾驶等领域持续布局。\n\n近年来，百度明确提出\"All in AI\"战略，将人工智能作为驱动所有业务的核心引擎。从搜索广告的智能化改造，到智能云基础设施的规模化商用，再到萝卜快跑无人驾驶出行服务的全球扩张，百度正以AI重新定义自身的商业边界。2025年，百度AI业务营收已达400亿元，占总营收比例超过三成，标志着AI从技术投入阶段正式迈入规模化商业兑现期。\n\n本系列文档从企业文化与管理视角，深入解析百度的AI转型之路。第一章**文化与价值观**探讨百度\"All in AI\"的转型决心、技术信仰文化以及从搜索到AI的演进逻辑；第二章**绩效体系**分析百度独具特色的OKR实践、AI研发投入考核以及创新激励机制；第三章**组织与人才**聚焦李彦宏的技术领导力、AI人才战略以及事业群架构调整；第四章**战略与方法论**深入研究文心一言大模型战略、Apollo自动驾驶商业化路径以及AI原生应用生态的构建。\n\n百度的AI转型故事，既有技术理想主义的坚持，也有商业现实的博弈；既有战略远见的回报，也有\"起大早赶晚集\"的反思。这些经验对于正在经历数字化转型的中国企业，具有重要的参考价值。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"culture-and-values","title":"文化与价值观","docCount":7,"url":"/h/corporate-management/baidu-ai/culture-and-values","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"all-in-ai-transformation","title":"百度 All in AI 战略转型","url":"/h/corporate-management/baidu-ai/culture-and-values/all-in-ai-transformation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"technology-belief-culture","title":"百度技术信仰文化","url":"/h/corporate-management/baidu-ai/culture-and-values/technology-belief-culture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"search-to-ai-evolution","title":"百度从搜索到AI的演进之路","url":"/h/corporate-management/baidu-ai/culture-and-values/search-to-ai-evolution"},{"seq":4,"slug":"mission-vision-evolution","title":"百度使命与愿景演变","url":"/h/corporate-management/baidu-ai/culture-and-values/mission-vision-evolution"},{"seq":5,"slug":"robin-li-ai-belief-leadership","title":"李彦宏的 AI 信仰与领导风格","url":"/h/corporate-management/baidu-ai/culture-and-values/robin-li-ai-belief-leadership"},{"seq":6,"slug":"core-values-evolution","title":"百度核心价值观的演变与落地","url":"/h/corporate-management/baidu-ai/culture-and-values/core-values-evolution"},{"seq":7,"slug":"tech-belief-in-decisions","title":"技术信仰文化在实际决策中的体现","url":"/h/corporate-management/baidu-ai/culture-and-values/tech-belief-in-decisions"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"performance-system","title":"绩效体系","docCount":3,"url":"/h/corporate-management/baidu-ai/performance-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"okr-practice","title":"百度 OKR 实践与演进","url":"/h/corporate-management/baidu-ai/performance-system/okr-practice"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ai-rd-investment-metrics","title":"百度 AI 研发投入与考核","url":"/h/corporate-management/baidu-ai/performance-system/ai-rd-investment-metrics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"innovation-incentive-system","title":"百度创新激励机制","url":"/h/corporate-management/baidu-ai/performance-system/innovation-incentive-system"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"org-and-talent","title":"组织与人才","docCount":3,"url":"/h/corporate-management/baidu-ai/org-and-talent","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"robin-li-leadership","title":"李彦宏的技术领导力","url":"/h/corporate-management/baidu-ai/org-and-talent/robin-li-leadership"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ai-talent-strategy","title":"百度 AI 人才战略","url":"/h/corporate-management/baidu-ai/org-and-talent/ai-talent-strategy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"business-group-structure","title":"百度事业群架构演变","url":"/h/corporate-management/baidu-ai/org-and-talent/business-group-structure"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"strategy-and-methodology","title":"战略与方法论","docCount":3,"url":"/h/corporate-management/baidu-ai/strategy-and-methodology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ernie-bot-strategy","title":"文心一言大模型战略","url":"/h/corporate-management/baidu-ai/strategy-and-methodology/ernie-bot-strategy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"apollo-autonomous-driving","title":"百度 Apollo 自动驾驶战略","url":"/h/corporate-management/baidu-ai/strategy-and-methodology/apollo-autonomous-driving"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-native-application-ecosystem","title":"百度 AI 原生应用生态","url":"/h/corporate-management/baidu-ai/strat